{"status": 200, "url": "https://www-breitachklamm-com.translate.goog?_x_tr_sl=de&_x_tr_tl=en&_x_tr_hl=en", "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html class=\"c109416\" lang=\"de\" xml:lang=\"de\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<base href=\"https://www.breitachklamm.com/\"/>\n<title>Breitachklamm Oberstdorf/ Kleinwalsertal</title>\n<meta content=\"Die tiefste Felsenschlucht Mitteleuropas erstreckt sich von Oberstdorf bis ins benachbarte Kleinwalsertal. Wandern Sie durch das faszinierende Naturerlebnis.\" name=\"description\"/>\n<meta content=\"Attraktion, Ausflug, Breitachklamm, Felsenschlucht, Klamm, Kleinwalsertal, Oberstdorf\" name=\"keywords\"/>\n<meta content=\"text/html;charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<meta content=\"index, follow\" name=\"robots\"/>\n<meta content=\"16.11.2026 07:50:25,fresh\" name=\"tramino-cache\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n<link href=\"https://www.breitachklamm.com/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/s/breitachklamm/596405/favicon.ico\" rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/2800_2256.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/824_3.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/2883_1524.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/4120_60.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/3377_184.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/2897_158.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/5122_53.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/4483_68.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/3219_241.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/3201_151.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/2820_349.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://tramino.s3.amazonaws.com/css/3639_161.css?r=57\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<!-- Init Consent -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<meta content=\"origin\" name=\"referrer\"/>\n<link href=\"https://storage.tramino.net/static/iconfonts/tramino/v1.41/style.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"https://storage.tramino.net/static/tramini/iconfont/css/styles.min.css?c=950980\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n\n\n\n<meta content=\"Breitachklamm Oberstdorf/ Kleinwalsertal\" property=\"og:title\"/>\n<meta content=\"Die tiefste Felsenschlucht Mitteleuropas erstreckt sich von Oberstdorf bis ins benachbarte Kleinwalsertal. Wandern Sie durch das faszinierende Naturerlebnis.\" property=\"og:description\"/>\n<meta content=\"Breitachklamm\" property=\"og:site_name\"/>\n<meta content=\"Website\" property=\"og:type\"/>\n<meta content=\"https://www.breitachklamm.com/\" property=\"og:url\"/>\n<meta content=\"https://storage.tramino.net/breitachklamm/884866/800.jpg?r=3\" property=\"og:image\"/>\n<meta content=\"Google\" http-equiv=\"X-Translated-By\"/>\n<meta content=\"en\" http-equiv=\"X-Translated-To\"/>\n\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n\n<meta content=\"none\" name=\"robots\"/>\n</head>\n<body class=\"Mandant_1866 Rubrik_109416 mainpage\" id=\"body\">\n\n<div id=\"page\">\n<div id=\"TraminoR